For loop: SYNTAX
for(Initialization; condition; update)
{
//statements
}

eg: 
for(i = 1; i<=5; i++)
{
printf("hello");
}

output: 1 2 3 4 5


while - condition based loop
for - iteration based loop, when you know how many iterations you should execute.

